<rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>mapx Blog – Cycling</title><link>https://blog.mapx.at/tags/cycling/</link><description>Recent content in Cycling on mapx Blog</description><generator>Hugo -- gohugo.io</generator><language>de</language><lastBuildDate>Sun, 08 Nov 2026 04:20:00 +0100</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="https://blog.mapx.at/tags/cycling/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>Bike and MTB routing with a cycle-route layer</title><link>https://blog.mapx.at/rad-mtb-profil-und-radrouten-en/</link><pubDate>Sun, 08 Nov 2026 04:20:00 +0100</pubDate><guid>https://blog.mapx.at/rad-mtb-profil-und-radrouten-en/</guid><description>
&lt;p&gt;Cyclists care about more than distance: how much climbing, how steep, on what surface. The Directions API provides that for the profiles &lt;code&gt;cycling&lt;/code&gt; and &lt;code&gt;cycling-mtb&lt;/code&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 data-hextra-search-id="request"&gt;Request&lt;span class="hx:absolute hx:-mt-20" id="request"&gt;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;a href="#request" class="subheading-anchor" aria-label="Permalink für diesen Abschnitt"&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;div class="hextra-code-block hx:relative hx:mt-6 hx:first:mt-0 hx:group/code"&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;div class="highlight"&gt;&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"&gt;&lt;code class="language-bash" data-lang="bash"&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;curl -s &lt;span class="s2"&gt;&amp;#34;https://api.mapx.at/v1/directions/cycling-mtb/15.3294,48.2272;15.4,48.2?steps=true&amp;amp;overview=false&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="p"&gt;|&lt;/span&gt; jq &lt;span class="s1"&gt;&amp;#39;.routes[0].summary, (.routes[0].legs[0].steps[1] | {name, bike_infrastructure, surface, ascent_m, descent_m, grade_pct})&amp;#39;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class="hextra-code-copy-btn-container hx:opacity-0 hx:transition hx:group-hover/code:opacity-100 hx:flex hx:gap-1 hx:absolute hx:m-[11px] hx:right-0 hx:top-0"&gt;
&lt;button
class="hextra-code-copy-btn hx:group/copybtn hx:cursor-pointer hx:transition-all hx:active:opacity-50 hx:bg-primary-700/5 hx:border hx:border-black/5 hx:text-gray-600 hx:hover:text-gray-900 hx:rounded-md hx:p-1.5 hx:dark:bg-primary-300/10 hx:dark:border-white/10 hx:dark:text-gray-400 hx:dark:hover:text-gray-50"
title="Code kopieren"
aria-label="Code kopieren"
data-copied-label="Kopiert!"
&gt;
&lt;div class="hextra-copy-icon hx:group-[.copied]/copybtn:hidden hx:pointer-events-none hx:h-4 hx:w-4"&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class="hextra-success-icon hx:hidden hx:group-[.copied]/copybtn:block hx:pointer-events-none hx:h-4 hx:w-4"&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/button&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Response on 8 Nov 2026 (Melk, about 8.3 km):&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class="hextra-code-block hx:relative hx:mt-6 hx:first:mt-0 hx:group/code"&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;div class="highlight"&gt;&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"&gt;&lt;code class="language-json" data-lang="json"&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;{&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nt"&gt;&amp;#34;ascent_m&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="mf"&gt;48.7&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;,&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nt"&gt;&amp;#34;descent_m&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="mf"&gt;37.9&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;,&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nt"&gt;&amp;#34;max_grade_pct&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="mf"&gt;8.8&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;,&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nt"&gt;&amp;#34;min_elevation_m&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="mf"&gt;211.8&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;,&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nt"&gt;&amp;#34;max_elevation_m&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="mf"&gt;252.5&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;}&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;{&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nt"&gt;&amp;#34;name&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="s2"&gt;&amp;#34;Linzer Straße&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;,&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nt"&gt;&amp;#34;bike_infrastructure&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="s2"&gt;&amp;#34;none&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;,&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nt"&gt;&amp;#34;surface&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="s2"&gt;&amp;#34;paved&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;,&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nt"&gt;&amp;#34;ascent_m&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="mf"&gt;0.0&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;,&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nt"&gt;&amp;#34;descent_m&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="mf"&gt;0.0&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;,&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nt"&gt;&amp;#34;grade_pct&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="mf"&gt;0.3&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;}&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class="hextra-code-copy-btn-container hx:opacity-0 hx:transition hx:group-hover/code:opacity-100 hx:flex hx:gap-1 hx:absolute hx:m-[11px] hx:right-0 hx:top-0"&gt;
&lt;button
class="hextra-code-copy-btn hx:group/copybtn hx:cursor-pointer hx:transition-all hx:active:opacity-50 hx:bg-primary-700/5 hx:border hx:border-black/5 hx:text-gray-600 hx:hover:text-gray-900 hx:rounded-md hx:p-1.5 hx:dark:bg-primary-300/10 hx:dark:border-white/10 hx:dark:text-gray-400 hx:dark:hover:text-gray-50"
title="Code kopieren"
aria-label="Code kopieren"
data-copied-label="Kopiert!"
&gt;
&lt;div class="hextra-copy-icon hx:group-[.copied]/copybtn:hidden hx:pointer-events-none hx:h-4 hx:w-4"&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class="hextra-success-icon hx:hidden hx:group-[.copied]/copybtn:block hx:pointer-events-none hx:h-4 hx:w-4"&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/button&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;code&gt;bike_infrastructure&lt;/code&gt; distinguishes &lt;code&gt;cycleway&lt;/code&gt;, &lt;code&gt;lane&lt;/code&gt;, &lt;code&gt;shared&lt;/code&gt; and &lt;code&gt;none&lt;/code&gt;; &lt;code&gt;surface&lt;/code&gt; distinguishes &lt;code&gt;paved&lt;/code&gt;, &lt;code&gt;cobblestone&lt;/code&gt;, &lt;code&gt;unpaved&lt;/code&gt;, &lt;code&gt;offroad&lt;/code&gt; and &lt;code&gt;unknown&lt;/code&gt;. The data comes from GIP.at.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 data-hextra-search-id="cycle-routes-on-the-map"&gt;Cycle routes on the map&lt;span class="hx:absolute hx:-mt-20" id="cycle-routes-on-the-map"&gt;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;a href="#cycle-routes-on-the-map" class="subheading-anchor" aria-label="Permalink für diesen Abschnitt"&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;The signposted bike and MTB routes are part of the &lt;code&gt;streets&lt;/code&gt; style as layer group &lt;code&gt;bike_routes&lt;/code&gt; (off by default):&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class="hextra-code-block hx:relative hx:mt-6 hx:first:mt-0 hx:group/code"&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;div class="highlight"&gt;&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"&gt;&lt;code class="language-js" data-lang="js"&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="kr"&gt;const&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="nx"&gt;map&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="o"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="nx"&gt;mapx&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nx"&gt;map&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;({&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="nx"&gt;container&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="o"&gt;:&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="s2"&gt;&amp;#34;map&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;,&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="nx"&gt;style&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="o"&gt;:&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="s2"&gt;&amp;#34;streets&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;,&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="nx"&gt;center&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="o"&gt;:&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="p"&gt;[&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="mf"&gt;15.45&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;,&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="mf"&gt;48.3&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;],&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="nx"&gt;zoom&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="o"&gt;:&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="mi"&gt;10&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="p"&gt;});&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="nx"&gt;map&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nx"&gt;addControl&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;(&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="k"&gt;new&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="nx"&gt;mapx&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nx"&gt;LayerControl&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;({&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="nx"&gt;groups&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="o"&gt;:&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="p"&gt;[&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="s2"&gt;&amp;#34;bike_routes&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;,&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="s2"&gt;&amp;#34;relief&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;]&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="p"&gt;}),&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="s2"&gt;&amp;#34;top-right&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;);&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class="hextra-code-copy-btn-container hx:opacity-0 hx:transition hx:group-hover/code:opacity-100 hx:flex hx:gap-1 hx:absolute hx:m-[11px] hx:right-0 hx:top-0"&gt;
&lt;button
