&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;More: &lt;a href="https://docs.mapx.at/use-cases/tourism/" target="_blank" rel="noopener"&gt;tourism use case&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="https://docs.mapx.at/api/directions/" target="_blank" rel="noopener"&gt;Directions API&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description></item></channel></rss>